 most two vertices covers the contribution from the first junk gate. Every remaining edge in Ustar must activate the second junk gate and have an endpoint in its safe vertex set. The reachability argument uses the OR-path machinery of c4ss in #4025.\n\nThe second child computes the deletion profile of the specified 16-edge graph. As the allowable residual vertex cover size runs from zero to seven, the minimum deleted-edge counts are 16, 12, 8, 5, 3, 2, 1 and 0. Both children have separately checked Lean proofs. The remaining child asks for the gate-count contradiction using the second gate and the stated OR penalty.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-24T22:31:55Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T22:31:55Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6f0528ec4a3a96705e70b6af86bd4a96cd9cff92","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WH3EL5:R-meta-5230-619","ref":"R-meta-5230-619","repo":{"id":1469600568,"node_id":"R_kgDOV5hTOA","name":"pequalnp-proofs","full_name":"WH3EL5/pequalnp-proofs","owner":{"login":"WH3EL5","id":27011576,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDExNTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27011576?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5","html_url":"https://github.com/WH3EL5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WH3EL5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public"